<title>SPAIN: Spain Aug currency reserves rose $420.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Spain Aug currency reserves rose $420.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars):</p>
<p> RESERVES		     AUG 96	JULY 96	AUG 95</p>
<p> Rise in month		 420.5	1,161.7	  227.7</p>
<p> End-month total	  55,123.5     54,703.0     37,304.1</p>
</text>
